{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21977","headline":"虾蟇 · 白居易","name":"虾蟇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉鱼荐宗朝，灵龟贡邦家。\n应龙能致雨，润我百谷芽。\n蠢蠢水族中，无用者虾蟇。\n形秽肌肉腥，出没於泥沙。\n六月七月交，时雨正滂沱。\n虾蟇得其志，快乐无以加。\n地既蕃其生，使之族类多。\n天又与其声，得以相諠譁。\n岂惟玉池上，汚君清冷波。\n可独瑶瑟前，乱君鹿鸣歌。\n常恐飞上天，跳跃随姮娥。\n往往蚀明月，遣君无奈何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}